  "question_stem": "A block of mass $4$ kg is pulled along a rough horizontal road by a constant force of magnitude $25$ N acting at an angle of $36^{\\circ}$ above the horizontal. The block moves in a straight line passing through two points $A$ and $B$ on the road, where $AB = 120$ m. The coefficient of friction between the block and the road is $0.4$.",
